# Everything the zip folder (dist/CMRLauncher-<version>/) may hold; anything
# else fails sdk/packaging/smoke-package.sh in CI. Never game files.
# Flags: x (executable), empty (may be empty), optional (may be missing).
CMRLauncher.exe
cmrhooks.dll
README.md
THIRD_PARTY.md
CHANGELOG.md
LICENSE-MIT
LICENSE-APACHE
linux/cmr-play x
linux/rea-play.sh
linux/README.md
linux/tests/*.sh
licenses/Barlow-OFL.txt
# The HD art pack (owner decision 2026-10-31, THIRD_PARTY.md): our redrawn
# and upscaled images, never the game's own files.
hd/pack.txt
hd/x2/*.png
hd/x2/*.webp
hd/x4/*.png
hd/x4/*.webp
